# field-notebook.roles - which Field Notebook colour fills each role.
#
# By ANSI meaning, so the CLI tools agree with what Ghostty and the Omarchy
# theme already paint (Omarchy renders colors.toml with green = the pen):
# the accent slot `green` is the pen, the chrome fills are pen tints, and
# nothing borrows OneDark's greys. Format: role|colour name in
# field-notebook.conf.

bg|bg
bg-dark|bg-dark
surface|border
fg|fg
comment|fg-faint
blue|blue
cyan|cyan
green|pen
yellow|yellow
magenta|magenta
vermilion|red
terracotta|orange
ultramarine|selection
viridian|pen-deep
diff-add|selection
diff-del|selection-red
